{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>In its first year.</b> Were it not for the tradition, who would interpret for us בן שנתו — whether if it is בן שנה תמימה it is not more or less, or additions. And some say the reason for the lamb as burnt offering: lest some thought arose upon her spirit at the time of giving birth, from the intensity of the suffering. Sin offering: lest she spoke with her mouth."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:41.145719727Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}